      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Halfmoon%2C_New_York"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Mohican tribe sold the plains of Halfmoon to Philip Schuyler and Goosen Van Schaick in 1664.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Halfmoon%2C_New_York"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Halfmoon was officially formed as a town in 1788 while it was still part of Albany County.",
